  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute",
    "Add the Thai red curry paste and cook for 1-2 minutes until fragrant",
    "Add the egg plants and cook for 5 minutes until they start to soften",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and add the fish sauce, palm sugar, salt, and black pepper",
    "Stir well and bring the mixture to a simmer",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook for 10-15 minutes until the egg plants are tender and the sauce has thickened"
